      "updated": 1791128864810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refresh flow (agent or UI asks for fresh prices)",
      "originalText": "Refresh flow (agent or UI asks for fresh prices)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2C"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3_98_3645",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4150,
      "width": 1093.4,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1298896648,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1532463246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791128864810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Agent calls request_refresh(tracker_id) → API checks the cooldown, inserts a row in refresh_requests (pending), returns request_id at once.\n2. Scraper worker (every minute) calls GET /api/refresh-requests/next → gets the oldest pending request, marked running.\n3. Worker scrapes the product page from the home IP.\n4. Worker calls POST /api/prices (batch, idempotent on tracker_id + scraped_at) → rows in prices.\n5. Worker calls POST /api/refresh-requests/{id}/done (or /failed with the reason).\n6. Agent calls get_refresh_status(request_id) → pending / running / done / failed, plus the new price.",
      "originalText": "1. Agent calls request_refresh(tracker_id) → API checks the cooldown, inserts a row in refresh_requests (pending), returns request_id at once.\n2. Scraper worker (every minute) calls GET /api/refresh-requests/next → gets the oldest pending request, marked running.\n3. Worker scrapes the product page from the home IP.\n4. Worker calls POST /api/prices (batch, idempotent on tracker_id + scraped_at) → rows in prices.\n5. Worker calls POST /api/refresh-requests/{id}/done (or /failed with the reason).\n6. Agent calls get_refresh_status(request_id) → pending / running / done / failed, plus the new price.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2D"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3_99_4126",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4295,
      "width": 900.9000000000001,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 403829496,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1311608658,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791128864810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scheduled mode is the same loop: cron starts the worker, which refreshes every active tracker instead of one request.",
      "originalText": "Scheduled mode is the same loop: cron starts the worker, which refreshes every active tracker instead of one request.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2E"
    },
