      "updated": 1791139953215,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trackers\n  GET    /trackers\n  GET    /trackers/{id}\n  POST   /trackers           (allow-list, cap)\n  PATCH  /trackers/{id}      (target price, active)\n\nPrices\n  GET    /trackers/{id}/prices?days=\n  GET    /trackers/{id}/summary\n  POST   /prices             (scraper only)\n\nRefresh requests\n  POST   /refresh-requests   (cooldown)\n  GET    /refresh-requests/{id}\n  GET    /refresh-requests/next   (scraper)\n  POST   /refresh-requests/{id}/done|failed\n\nGET /health",
      "originalText": "Trackers\n  GET    /trackers\n  GET    /trackers/{id}\n  POST   /trackers           (allow-list, cap)\n  PATCH  /trackers/{id}      (target price, active)\n\nPrices\n  GET    /trackers/{id}/prices?days=\n  GET    /trackers/{id}/summary\n  POST   /prices             (scraper only)\n\nRefresh requests\n  POST   /refresh-requests   (cooldown)\n  GET    /refresh-requests/{id}\n  GET    /refresh-requests/next   (scraper)\n  POST   /refresh-requests/{id}/done|failed\n\nGET /health",
      "fontSize": 13,
